WEBVTT

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.980
Lord Orochimaru, what's wrong?

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:54.920
It's ready. My new 
jutsu is complete.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.510
Then...

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:05.180
We leave to crush the Leaf!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:16.400
<b>Orochimaru is a B-Type Scorpio</b>

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.410
Listen up, everyone!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.280
Today's mission is guard duty!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.240
Why, exactly?

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.730
Things have been very peaceful 
in the village lately,

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.370
so we're seeing more 
tourists than usual.

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.580
You three were chosen to 
help beef up security.

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:33.880
Yes, sir!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.370
It's going to be hard to 
distinguish potential threats...

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:38.720
...from ordinary tourists just by sight.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.970
Stay vigilant, but make the 
tourists feel welcome, too!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.180
Understood.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.390
I have an idea.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:53.150
Lord Orochimaru, what exactly is 
the new jutsu you created?

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.170
This.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.140
What is it?

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:01.280
A crystal orb linked to 
an alternate dimension!

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.730
I need only release it 
within the Leaf Village,

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.210
and it will be obliterated 
in mere moments!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.580
Incredible...

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.700
For those who don't know, 
this is Orochimaru.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:19.370
He was once well respected in the
Leaf Village as one of the famously...

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.250
...talented Legendary Sannin.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.890
But he became corrupted,
and now uses his skills for evil.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.170
Take a gander.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:30.390
Oh, he may be somewhat 
flamboyant, but he's a man.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.650
<b>Security Inspections In Progress</b>

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.650
<b>Leaf Villagers</b>

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.650
<b>Visitors</b>

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.540
What's this?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.290
I'm not sure.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:47.160
Attention, everyone! Leaf villagers
please line up to the left!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.410
Visitors and tourists to the right, please!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:55.970
It looks like they're checking everyone
who wants to enter the village.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.290
What is the meaning of this?!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:01.840
Why are we doing it like this?

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:07.600
It makes it pretty painless for 
tourists to enter the village.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.400
Whatever security they've got here,

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.350
it can't be worse than going 
through customs at the airport.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.560
Lord Orochimaru, 
you said that quite casually,

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.690
but do airports actually 
exist in this anime?

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:21.850
If we disguise ourselves
as ordinary tourists,

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:24.450
and blend in with the crowd, 
they'll wave us right through.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:28.660
<b>Hawaii 
Travel</b>

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.160
I see.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.660
We just have to act casual, right?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.890
Flawless, no?

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.320
How can you call this ordinary?

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:41.900
Look how casually I'm wearing 
this hibiscus on my shirt!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.350
You're applying the 
"casual" idea improperly.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:47.520
Regardless, we'll be fine if 
we follow this guidebook.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.680
Excuse me.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.140
Are you two trying to get 
into the Leaf Village?

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:55.380
<i>Oh, no, we need a cover story!</i>

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.980
Yes, I am tourist, okay?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.820
<i>You didn't need the guidebook for that!</i>

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.280
It's vacation, okay?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.130
<i>I think Lord Orochimaru's 
brain is on vacation.</i>

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.510
I don't like how this other 
guy keeps mumbling...

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:12.040
Okay, okay, no problem!

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.450
Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.220
<i>But this kid's a moron.</i>

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.410
<i>We might actually pull it off.</i>

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.000
Sorry, passport, okay?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.180
<i>What's a passport?</i>

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.880
<i>Whatever it is, he doesn't have one!</i>

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.770
Yes, my passport size, okay?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.350
A compact camera gag?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.100
No one will get it!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.270
Sorry. I speak the language.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:41.360
Oh, okay, we'll need to check you 
before you can enter the village.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.060
Lately, we've had incidents with
illegal ninjutsu users,

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.450
and pirated taijutsu and genjutsu.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.330
I understand illegal ninjutsu,

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.160
but pirated taijutsu and genjutsu?

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.420
I-I understand the temptation 
to follow up on the joke,

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.640
but we'll need you to 
cooperate with us, sir.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:03.210
First off, we don't allow anyone 
to bring in lighters or matches.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:08.000
And we have a strict limit of ten
kilograms of chakra per person.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:21.130
<b>Chakra</b>

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:21.130
<b>10 kilo limit</b>

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:21.130
<b>per person.</b>

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.840
Wait, is that a lot or a little?

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.180
Can you even weigh chakra?!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:17.100
Please separate all ninjutsu 
into 250-milliliter containers.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.330
Ninjutsu in containers?!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.150
None of this makes sense!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.830
Guess we're stuck.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.840
And why did you have it prepared 
like you expected it?!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:32.520
Is it strange that I'm the only one
who has no idea what's going on?

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:34.490
Yes, you're an idiot, too!

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.000
Lastly, we need to scan your luggage.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.250
There are no words.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.210
Byakugan!

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.010
Why do we even have a conveyor belt?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.220
You won't beat me!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.310
Byakugan!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.600
Lee, that's still pointless!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.610
Hey, what set it off?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.950
Perhaps it's this.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.030
You can't bring that into the village!

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.860
And why was it in your mouth?!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.360
<i>The orb is in my suitcase,</i>

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:14.200
<i>but they'll have no 
idea what it really is!</i>

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:16.880
Freeze.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.660
Did you really think you'd 
be able to trick me?

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.540
What are you hiding?

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.320
<i>Does he suspect the orb?</i>

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.010
<i>Or has he seen through my disguise?!</i>

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.640
You can confess, or we can 
do this the hard way.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.190
<i>He's got me!</i>

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.020
It's true!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.630
I am Orochimaru!

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:47.620
I commend you for catching me,

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.630
but now playtime is over!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:50.360
I said, what is this?

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.890
I'm sorry, it's an uncensored scroll.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.570
That was it?!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.080
I mean, er, I... um...

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.560
<b>Be on the lookout for these two!!</b>

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:08.840
My apologizes. That was my fault.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.090
What's done is done, however...

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.050
We still have one option.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.640
Is this really going to work?

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.580
We've got no luggage,

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:29.610
and I hid the orb in my pocket. 
We'll be fine.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:34.490
Excuse me, sir. We'll need to 
do a security inspection.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.250
I am a ninja from the 
Hidden Ridge Village.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.580
I am on a training journey, 
visiting each country.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.200
Can we see your luggage?

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.290
I need no luggage on 
my training journey.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:45.590
Please let me through.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.300
Wait, hold it!

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.290
What?

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.920
We're not just scanning luggage,

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.590
we're doing body checks, too.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:54.910
<i>Body checks?!</i>

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:55.050
<b>Oh no!</b>

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:58.410
<i>They'll find me under the coat for sure!</i>

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:01.870
We've had issues with ninjas
wearing knockoff clothing.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.170
<i>Knockoff?</i>

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.810
<i>Of what, the Hokage's outfit?</i>

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.510
Also, as a ninja you should be 
capable of basic techniques.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.980
Please demonstrate one for us.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:12.970
<i>They say body checks,</i>

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.430
<i>but they aren't going to pat us down.</i>

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.990
<i>We just need to show we're a real ninja.</i>

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.120
First,

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:25.230
Fire Style: Matchmaking!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:29.170
<b>Fire Style: Matchmaking</b>

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:29.170
That's no fire technique, 
you just threw lit matches.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.720
Fine, I'll show you my ninjutsu!

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.810
Ouch!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:42.010
<i>Hot! Hot foot, Lord Orochimaru!</i>

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:46.890
Also, we don't allow anyone to 
bring in lighters or matches.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.500
Forget the matches, 
he's actually on fire!

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:51.980
We have to put it out!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.890
Water Style: Public Waterway!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.110
<i>Don't get that on me!</i>

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.380
It's not what you think!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:05.710
I just spilled the chakra while
you were hopping about!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.790
How does one spill chakra?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:15.610
Please separate all liquids 
into 250-milliliter containers.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.220
Let's get you dried off.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.220
Wind Style: Evaporation Rotation!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.520
<i>That would really help me dry off.</i>

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.710
<i>Wait, is he going to spin, too?</i>

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.320
<i>If he turns now, he'll blow our cover!</i>

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.190
<i>Don't do it, Kabuto!</i>

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.920
That wind was so strong, 
I had to close my eyes.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:56.030
It looks like you really are a ninja.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:58.510
Go right on through.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>Well done, Kabuto!</i>

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.770
<i>Now we need only to release the 
orb within the Leaf Village!</i>

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.270
Ah, I almost forgot.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.240
Oh, thank you.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:19.530
Welcome to the Leaf Village!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.920
What is this?!

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.270
That tickles!

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.610
No, get away from there―

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:45.110
Stop it, stop it―

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:45.780
No, no―

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:46.580
In the end,

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:51.480
Orochimaru's evil plot was foiled
right outside the village gate!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.450
Lord Orochimaru, are you okay?!

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.800
Do I look okay?

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:14.290
I ended up like this 
because my plan failed!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.740
What kind of plan ends with a postman
getting thrown out with the garbage,

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:20.550
wrapped in international flags?

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.180
It was those meddling kids again!

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.140
Meddling kids?

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:26.910
Not them!

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:33.310
They'll pay for this!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:43.360
<b>Love Letters are the Ultimate Trap</b>

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:50.580
Rock Lee              Neji Hyuga                 Tenten

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:49.830
Their names are Rock Lee,
Neji Hyuga, and Tenten.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.440
No other information?

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:55.510
No, I'm still researching 
the three of them.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.490
So be it.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:03.000
I'll just have to expose 
their weak points myself.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:06.860
They are obstacles to my goals,

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.190
and they must be crushed!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.010
Today's training will 
be tough, everyone,

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.610
so psych yourselves up 
and follow my lead!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:16.210
Yes!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:18.900
Do we really have enough 
free time to train?

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.610
It's okay.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:24.270
Naruto's team is covering 
our shift today.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.780
Since when do we work in shifts?

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:30.690
We've got the day off, 
we should train our butts off!

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:32.290
That's not a day off!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.080
That's them.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.300
I see, so they're Might Guy's students.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:40.420
No wonder they're all so exaggerated.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:41.880
Lee...

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:46.550
If you can land a single 
blow on me, you pass.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.970
Understood.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.670
Lee looks ready to rumble.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:53.220
He and Guy Sensei haven't 
faced off in a while.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.100
Shimura Style: Secret Strike!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.310
Wow!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.370
Not that again!

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.570
<i>Well met, Lee...</i>

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.400
<i>I only showed you that attack once,</i>

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.610
<i>and you've already learned it.</i>

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.080
Here I go.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.160
Wow!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.160
Too slow!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:21.500
W-What... is this?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.250
<b>Rock Lee</b>

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.100
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:33.310
"Dear Lee...

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.850
I've admired you from 
afar for a long time.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.520
I'll be waiting for you behind 
the gym after school.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.390
I really want to talk to you."

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:43.330
A love letter?!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.550
Could Sakura finally...

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:50.870
Rocky got himself a love letter!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.700
Go for it, loser!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.550
Go have a ball with your new girl!

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:58.240
You sound totally jealous.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.930
I'm not jealous.

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:03.050
And I'm not resentful, either!

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.960
C'mon, you two, get in on the action!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.050
Heh heh...

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.990
<i>Why am I doing this?</i>

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:11.100
I, um...

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:14.060
Yup, it's a lover letter!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:15.960
You're a real smooth operator, Rocky!

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:18.560
Knock it off!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.150
Free hit!

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.390
You're too gullible, Lee.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.640
That's what happens when you drop...

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:29.240
...your guard while you're 
in the enemy's range.

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.990
No way. You planned all that out?

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.910
Yes.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.840
This is a new move I've been polishing.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.710
The Smooth Operator Fist!

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.980
W-What on earth...

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:48.090
It looked like a skit.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:51.720
The Smooth Operator Fist 
is a high level move,

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.890
because it not only uses your own
power, but your comrades' as well.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.090
Guy Sensei, you're incredible!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.090
Lee.

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.550
If you truly want to be a strong ninja,

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:03.150
despite not being able to use ninjutsu,

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:04.970
you must take this move I've given you,

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:09.230
and refine it to even 
higher levels yourself!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.840
Y-Yes, sir...

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:15.550
The main takeaway is that 
that boy can't use ninjutsu.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:16.780
Now that we know that,

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.900
I need only defeat his taijutsu.

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.860
He'll have a complete breakdown when...

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.540
...he realizes he's totally 
powerless before me!

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:33.760
I have to improve Guy Sensei's 
moves on my own?

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.630
"Dear Lee...

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:43.640
I've admired you from 
afar for a long time.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.500
I'll be waiting for you 
up on the mountain.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.150
I really want to talk to you."

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.650
G-Guy Sensei again?!

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.570
<i>Then maybe this one's from Sakura!</i>

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.490
Where'd Lee go?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.650
Sakura!

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:04.370
Lee!

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:17.070
That happy, little tale drew 
you right in, did it?

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.390
That voice!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.790
Who are you, again?

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.010
Argh!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.340
Orochimaru! How could 
you forget already?!

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.490
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.190
But what're you doing here?

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.530
Read the letter and you'll understand.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.240
Letter?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:39.910
Oh yeah, did you see a 
pink-haired girl around here?

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.120
She wanted to talk to me.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.550
Argh!

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:45.780
How can you be so oblivious?!

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:47.210
What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.050
It means Lord Orochimaru was 
the one who sent that letter.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.220
I see you finally understand.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.840
Yes, but...

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.790
I'm sorry, I already like someone else!

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.850
Don't read into it that much!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.880
That's not what I meant!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:10.710
My ambition is to destroy 
the Hidden Leaf Village,

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:13.790
and the first step is getting 
rid of you right here and now!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.380
Not if I can help it.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:18.740
A boy who can't use ninjutsu 
is no match for me.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.200
We'll see about that!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.530
Take this! Snake Fist!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.920
Can your Snake Fist beat the real thing?

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:33.150
<i>I can't let him overwhelm me!</i>

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.330
How amusing.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.970
Your little attacks 
can't even scratch me!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.930
I'm not done...

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.430
<b>Leaf Bus</b>

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.570
D-Drunken Fist...

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:52.940
He got carsick so he could 
use the Drunken Fist?

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.950
Look out, Lord Orochimaru!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.260
Lee, sweetie!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.790
I think you've had enough, hon.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.350
Your family's probably worried.

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:12.450
But...

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:16.080
Hold on, this is my song!

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.460
DJ, let me see the mic!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.760
Coil 
Snack Bar

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:29.050
Even my Drunken Fist isn't enough...

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:33.230
What was that skit from?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:36.440
Now to enjoy my meal.

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:41.950
<i>I can't give up yet.
There must be a way!</i>

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:44.660
<i>Lee.</i>

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.370
<i>If you truly want to be a strong ninja,</i>

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.860
<i>despite not being able to use ninjutsu,</i>

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:50.640
<i>You must take this move I've given you,</i>

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:54.450
<i>and refine it to even 
higher levels yourself!</i>

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.290
<i>But how?</i>

00:19:57.810 --> 00:20:01.030
Your luck ran out when 
you opened that letter.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:03.930
When you let people sweet
talk you, it always ends badly.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.230
And now you see why!

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:07.500
Letters...

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.270
Sweet talk...

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.260
I've got it!

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:22.400
What's this?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.610
<b>Orochimaru</b>

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:32.310
"I've admired you from 
afar for a long time.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:35.130
I'll be waiting for you behind 
the gym after school."

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:41.480
Gym, auditorium, it's all 
the same in the end!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.590
The Smooth Operator Fist 
is all about camouflage.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:49.060
I used the distraction to 
bring in reinforcements!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.180
This...

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.720
...is my improved version 
of Guy Sensei's move!

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.150
The "Sweet Talk and Sour Grapes Fist!"

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.190
<b>Sweet Talk and Sour Grapes Fist</b>

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:01.280
Team Guy, back Lee up!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.240
Right!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:04.320
W-W-Wait!

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.890
I'm ashamed.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:14.180
I tried to refine Guy Sensei's 
attack, but I still needed help.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.870
That's fine.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.980
No one becomes strong overnight.

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:20.920
Keep improving one step at a time.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:24.270
Your moves and yourself.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:25.930
Yes, sir!

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.480
Says the guy in the schoolgirl outfit.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:35.390
Next time...

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.540
Next time, I'll make that brat say "uncle!"

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:43.630
And so, Lee and Orochimaru take their 
relationship to the next level.

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:25.250
We've taken over the preview.

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:25.710
Indeed.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.410
Next week is "Even Hokages Wear Out,"

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:32.090
<b>Even Hokages Wear Out
Orochimaru is Persistent</b>

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:32.090
and "Orochimaru is Persistent."

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.720
Me? Persistent? Unthinkable!

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:37.100
Agreed, I don't it's true either.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.520
I'll show those accursed brats,

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:41.850
I'll make their lives miserable 
every single day if I have to!

00:23:42.280 --> 00:23:44.150
And you will help me, Kabuto!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:45.980
As you wish, Lord Orochimaru.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.500
That's the definition of "persistent."
